<article class="festival-article">
    
    <h1>Labyrinthine Cliffs</h1>
    <section>
        <img src=@Assets["/images/Festivals/FourWinds/Cliffs/LabyrinthineCliffs-Banner.png"] style="width:100%;" />
        <p>
            <!-- info about the cliffs and zephyrites -->
            Every year the Labyrinthine Cliffs hosts the Bazaar of the Four Winds. 
            Traders from all over the world come to hawk their wears.
        </p>
        <p>
            The Zephyrites continue to return to the Bazaar year after year 
            in order to keep their relationships and help raise funds to rebuild their Zephyr Sanctum.
        </p>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3>Taking Heart by Snargle Goldclaw</h3>
        <p>
            Located in the northeast of the Labyrinthine Cliffs, this book is part of The Goldclaw Holiday Collection.

        </p>
        <figure style="width:100%; max-width:400px;">
            <img src=@Assets["/images/Festivals/FourWinds/Cliffs/TakingHeartLocation.png"] style="width:100%;" />
            <figcaption>Location of the book 'Taking Heart' by Snargle Goldclaw</figcaption>
        </figure>
        
    </section>
</article>